BANIYE MAJLISE AZA ZAINAB..<br>
<br>
SANIYE MAJLISE AZA ZAINAB,<br>
WARISE SABRE FATIMA ZAINAB.<br>
<br>
Tujhko zalim ne belcha mara,<br>
Sar huwa haye tera do para,<br>
Jism ka khoon behgaya sara,<br>
Yun ghamo se hui reha Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Zindagi bhar mili na koi khushi,<br>
Dil pe chalti rahi ghamou ki churi,<br>
Phir bhatije ke saath qaid huwi,<br>
Gham ka toota na silsila Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Sham me phir huwi nayi uftaad,<br>
Kis tarah seh sakenge yeh bedad,<br>
Besahara hai Sayyade Sajjad,<br>
Chal basi haye bawafa Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Sar khule izdehaam me jana,<br>
Balwaye qaaso aam me jana,<br>
Tera darbare shaam me jana,<br>
Tha qayamat ka marhala Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Bekasi me huwi jafa tujhpar,<br>
Thi mazalim ki inteha tujhpar,<br>
Saare kunbe ka bojh tha tujhpar,<br>
Har qadam par thi Karbala Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Chain tu ne kabhi nahi paya,<br>
Zakhm par zakhm tune hai khaya,<br>
Sar pe har dam ghamo'n ka tha saya,<br>
Tujhpe hoti rahi jafa Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Samna tha tujhe qayamat ka,<br>
Ek pal bhi mila na rahat ka,<br>
Dardo gham ka har ek musibat ka,<br>
Hogaya tujhpe qatema Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Tere majaye ki azadari,<br>
Bangayi hai shaoore bedari,<br>
Dono aalam me ab bhi hai jari,<br>
Tere matam ka silsila Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab.<br>
<br>
Tha 'Hasan' isko farz ka ahsas,<br>
Hone paya na use qoufo hiraas,<br>
Baade Ashoor ban gayi Abbas,<br>
Besaharo'n ka aasra Zainab.<br>
Baniye majlise aza Zainab...